# Google Sheets API Configuration
VITE_GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_KEY=your_google_sheets_api_key_here

# Instructions for setting up Google Sheets API:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (console.cloud.google.com)
# 2. Create a new project or select existing one
# 3. Enable the Google Sheets API
# 4. Create credentials (API key)
# 5. Restrict the API key to Google Sheets API only
# 6. Make sure your spreadsheet is publicly viewable or share it with the service account
# 7. Copy the API key and paste it above